          "><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1110px] 3xl:max-w-[1480px] 4xl:max-w-[1960px] px-5 pt-7 pb-25"><header class="max-w-[968px] 3xl:max-w-[1180px] 4xl:max-w-[1360px] space-y-5"><h1 class="text-[36px] font-bold leading-snug">Komisyon ilk toplantısını yapıyor... TİP ve EMEP&#x27;ten komisyona isim önerisi: Barış, Demokrasi ve Eşit Yurttaşlık Komisyonu</h1><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-[#e0e0e0]"><span class="sr-only">Mahreç: Anka Haber</span><div class="mt-1"><div class="text-[12px] font-bold text-white">05.08.2025<!-- --> <!-- -->17:01</div><div class="mt-1 text-[12px] font-semibold text-white/70">Güncelleme<!-- -->: <!-- -->01.06.2026<!-- --> <!-- -->23:17</div></div></div></header></div></section><section class="bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1110px] 3xl:max-w-[1480px] 4xl:max-w-[1960px] px-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] items-start gap-6 pt-0 pb-8"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="relative w-full -mt-20"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px]"><div class="mt-3"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-black/10 bg-black rounded-xl"><div class="relative aspect-[16/9]"><img alt="Komisyon ilk toplantısını yapıyor... TİP ve EMEP&#x27;ten komisyona isim önerisi: Barış, Demokrasi ve Eşit Yurttaşlık Komisyonu" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 70vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.ankahaber.net%2Fupload%2FHaber%2F254346%2F254346.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=90 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.ankahaber.net%2Fupload%2FHaber%2F254346%2F254346.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=90 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.ankahaber.net%2Fupload%2FHaber%2F254346%2F254346.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=90 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.ankahaber.net%2Fupload%2FHaber%2F254346%2F254346.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=90 1080w, /_ne